ns.\nREVIEW evaluates current-candidate evidence independently; MANDATE authorizes movement, service, and closure separately.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| LIN-000 | route-topology | v4 | 12.0 | candidate-index | superseded |\n| LIN-001 | interlocking-build | v4 | 13.9 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-002 | power-map | v4 | 12.7 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-003 | consist-roster | v4 | 14.6 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-004 | route-topology | v4 | 13.4 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-005 | interlocking-build | v4 | 12.2 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-006 | power-map | v4 | 14.1 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-007 | consist-roster | v4 | 12.9 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-008 | route-topology | v4 | 14.8 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-009 | interlocking-build | v4 | 13.6 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-010 | power-map | v4 | 12.4 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-011 | consist-roster | v5 | 14.3 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-012 | route-topology | v5 | 13.1 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-013 | interlocking-build | v5 | 15.0 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-014 | power-map | v5 | 13.8 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-015 | consist-roster | v5 | 12.6 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-016 | route-topology | v5 | 14.5 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-017 | interlocking-build | v5 | 13.3 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-018 | power-map | v5 | 12.1 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-019 | consist-roster | v5 | 14.0 | candidate-index | superseded |\n| LIN-020 | route-topology | v5 | 12.8 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-021 | interlocking-build | v5 | 14.7 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-022 | power-map | v6 | 13.5 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-023 | consist-roster | v6 | 12.3 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN-024 | route-topology | v6 | 14.2 | candidate-index | current |\n| LIN