g rail-safety acknowledgment.\nReadiness requires current candidate-bound evidence for every blocking control, independent residual-risk review, and explicit acceptance by each authorized owner.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nREVIEW consumes evidence from MANDATE, TRACK, SIGNAL, POWER, ROLLING, CREW, WEATHER, CYBER, TELEMETRY, PASSENGER, and LINEAGE but does not mutate their states.\nAn artifact, semantic register, mechanical check, or submission proposal cannot self-authorize movement, passenger service, or closure.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| REV-000 | track | v4 | 11.0 | open-findings | superseded |\n| REV-001 | signal | v4 | 12.9 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-002 | power | v4 | 11.7 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-003 | operations | v4 | 13.6 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-004 | track | v4 | 12.4 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-005 | signal | v4 | 11.2 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-006 | power | v4 | 13.1 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-007 | operations | v4 | 11.9 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-008 | track | v4 | 13.8 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-009 | signal | v4 | 12.6 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-010 | power | v4 | 11.4 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-011 | operations | v5 | 13.3 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-012 | track | v5 | 12.1 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-013 | signal | v5 | 14.0 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-014 | power | v5 | 12.8 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-015 | operations | v5 | 11.6 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-016 | track | v5 | 13.5 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-017 | signal | v5 | 12.3 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-018 | power | v5 | 11.1 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-019 | operations | v5 | 13.0 | open-findings | superseded |\n| REV-020 | track | v5 | 11.8 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-021 | signal | v5 | 13.7 | open-findings | current |\n| REV-022 | power | v